#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Looking for a stunning, modern, and completely free WordPress store theme to "
"kickstart your online business? Prime Shopping Cart is built to make any "
"store—from fashion and electronics to beauty, jewelry, or even a personal "
"review blog—look incredibly sleek and instantly shoppable for your "
"customers. It comes packed with flexible storefront layouts, customizable "
"product filters, vibrant typography, and a Live Customizer so you can tweak "
"every detail in real time without touching a single line of code. It plays "
"nicely with popular page builders like Elementor, SiteOrigin, and WPBakery, "
"scales seamlessly across mobile, tablet, and desktop screens, and includes "
"translation-ready features with full WooCommerce compatibility. Whether you "
"are a beginner aiming to make your eCommerce site smoothly shoppable or a "
"developer who loves clean, extensible code, this shop template has "
"everything you need to stand out and start selling fast!"
